        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This post walks through a seven-layer composable reference architecture designed to take multi-agent AI applications from prototype to production scale.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/pluggable-agentic-ai-framework-a-seven-layer-composable-enterprise-agentic-ai-reference-architecture-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/",
