      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Pluggable Agentic AI Framework is a reference architecture for multi-agent applications organized into seven layers , each with a distinct responsibility and a stable contract.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/pluggable-agentic-ai-framework-a-seven-layer-composable-enterprise-agentic-ai-reference-architecture-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:05:54.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:12.833Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Figure 1: The seven layers of the Pluggable Agentic AI Framework",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/pluggable-agentic-ai-framework-a-seven-layer-composable-enterprise-agentic-ai-reference-architecture-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:05:54.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:12.833Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Base , Vector Engine for Amazon OpenSearch Serverless , Amazon S3 Vectors and Amazon DynamoDB are example building blocks for this foundation.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/pluggable-agentic-ai-framework-a-seven-layer-composable-enterprise-agentic-ai-reference-architecture-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:05:54.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:12.833Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Consider using Strands Agents for specialists, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore harness for the orchestrator, AWS Agent Registry and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway for centralized discovery and routing.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/pluggable-agentic-ai-framework-a-seven-layer-composable-enterprise-agentic-ai-reference-architecture-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:05:54.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:12.833Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Authenticate every request, whether it comes from a user, another agent, or an automated workflow, through a service like Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Identity .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/pluggable-agentic-ai-framework-a-seven-layer-composable-enterprise-agentic-ai-reference-architecture-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:05:54.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:12.833Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Consider using Amazon Bedrock Guardrails for user inputs, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Identity and Policy in Amazon Bedrock AgentCore for authentication and access control, along with AWS Security and governance controls to bring defense-in-depth security.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/pluggable-agentic-ai-framework-a-seven-layer-composable-enterprise-agentic-ai-reference-architecture-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:05:54.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:12.833Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Consider using Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations for scoring and Amazon Bedrock AgentCore optimization for continuous performance tuning.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/pluggable-agentic-ai-framework-a-seven-layer-composable-enterprise-agentic-ai-reference-architecture-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:05:54.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:12.833Z"
      },
      {
